  "body": "## New Features\r\n\r\n- **Talk about papers naturally** — multi-paper context with an agentic flow and resolver, so you can reference several papers in one conversation.\r\n- **Fuzzy /load box** — fuzzy-find with full content search, multi-line input, and a bottom-anchored status line; the library auto-indexes on startup.\r\n- **Multi-select in /load** — select multiple papers at once, with lf/ranger-style highlight bars.\r\n\r\n## UI & themes\r\n\r\n- Tree pane toggle and rebalanced folded pane widths.\r\n- Interactive theme chooser with better icons, contrast, and cursor visibility.\r\n- Reclaimed vertical space and made the Files pane visually primary.\r\n- New launch splash screen."
